<back><div type="verses">
<lg label="2."><l>O blessed the grace that has made us</l><l>The home of the gladness of God,</l><l>The dwelling wherein Thou delightest,</l><l>The house Thou hast bought with Thy blood.</l><l>’Tis there that Thy joy overfloweth,</l><l>We feel it, we take of it there;</l><l>By all that Thou workest within us,</l><l>Thy temple is holy and fair.</l></lg>
<lg label="3."><l>The secret of that inner chamber,</l><l>Thy place is of heavenly rest;</l><l>The stillness of thoughts that adore Thee,</l><l>The shrine that Thou lovest the best.</l><l>The temple where Christ hath His dwelling</l><l>The souls He hath ransomed, forgiv’n;</l><l>The temple where I have my dwelling,</l><l>Is Christ in the glory of heav’n.</l></lg>
</div>
</back>
</music></mei>
